{"_id":"62822e7b697665e44795455c","title":"Spotify Player","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c77d0f","gameId":0,"name":"Universal Script 📌","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"slug":"universal","path":"/game/universal","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":0},"slug":"Universal-Script-Spotify-Player-2714","verified":false,"key":false,"keyless":false,"views":17500,"executes":1097,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":true,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","indexUnlisted":false,"image":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-script.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/7487966-1658461283732.jpg","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/7487966-1658461283732.jpg"},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-script.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/7487966-1658461283732.jpg","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/7487966-1658461283732.jpg"},"likeCount":0,"dislikeCount":2,"createdAt":"2022-05-16T10:59:07.320Z","updatedAt":"2022-05-16T10:59:07.320Z","lastBump":"2022-05-16T10:59:07.320Z","script":"loadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/zzerexx/scripts/main/SpotifyPlayer.lua\"))()","features":"NOTICE\nTo use this script, you will need to enter an API token.\nThis token is used for API authentication purposes and WILL NOT be saved or sent ANYWHERE. This GUI is open-source and can be viewed.\n\nWhy do I need to enter an API Token?\nAn API Token is required to use the Spotify Web API.\n\nSpotify Player only uses this API to do the following:\n- Get the song that is currently playing\n- Get album covers and artist avatars (to view in the UI)\n- Control playback (such as skipping songs or pausing/resuming playback)\n\n-------------------------------\n\nin-game spotify player with media controls and more\n\n- basic media controls (shuffle, previous song, play/pause, next song, repeat, seek)\n- view the current song name, song cover, artist name(s), and artist avatar (hold down on images to enlarge)\n- mini player (click spotify logo)\n\nHOW TO USE:\nclick on the key icon in the top right to get started\n\nsupported exploits:\n- script-ware\n- synapse x\n- krnl\n- and other exploits with a request function","tags":["spotify","music","player"],"discord":"","keyLink":"","owner":{"_id":"61d21c8e06b289703ecad5bc","username":"zzerexx","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/61d21c8e06b289703ecad5bc-1641162491200.png"},"status":"offline","id":"61d21c8e06b289703ecad5bc","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.executions","tier":10000},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/61d21c8e06b289703ecad5bc-1641162491200.png"}},"reviewed":null,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"cstatus":{"verdict":"none","pct":null,"conf":0,"n":{"w":0,"b":0,"p":0,"d":0,"k":0},"total":0,"detected":false,"key":false,"recent":0,"at":"2026-10-19T18:16:57.964Z","last":"","win":14,"math":3},"isHub":false,"supportedGames":[],"changelog":[{"_id":"67e5e1e2b360710ec3c4b546","editBy":{"_id":"61d21c8e06b289703ecad5bc","username":"zzerexx","status":"offline","id":"61d21c8e06b289703ecad5bc"},"message":"Create script","createdAt":"2022-05-17T04:03:26.876Z"},{"_id":"67e5e1e2b360710ec3c4b547","editBy":{"_id":"61d21c8e06b289703ecad5bc","username":"zzerexx","status":"offline","id":"61d21c8e06b289703ecad5bc"},"message":"Update script","createdAt":"2022-07-22T04:43:58.261Z"},{"_id":"67e5e1e3b360710ec3c4e701","editBy":{"_id":"61d21c8e06b289703ecad5bc","username":"zzerexx","status":"offline","id":"61d21c8e06b289703ecad5bc"},"message":"Update script","createdAt":"2025-03-27T21:26:36.641Z"}],"comments":[{"_id":"62838ec19d630739b370b854","commentBy":{"_id":"626341e30d24ab41434258f4","username":"Arcturus","verified":true,"role":"admin","profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/3411efcd89eeb9b608a